s the finding's own column rather than the ambient selection. No member-kind branch was added to either component.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"Claude Opus 5 (direct, outside the codex harness — user instruction)\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"stale-notice-coverage\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The stale replay notice is pinned in both directions from the locale key; inverting its condition fails the test.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"Claude Opus 5 (direct, outside the codex harness — user instruction)\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"work-package-link-and-assertions\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"The checklist link is now made through the select and read back from the store; the readiness assertion states its own expected value and matches /^準備完了$/ exactly.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"Claude Opus 5 (direct, outside the codex harness — user instruction)\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"uc25-self-assertion\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"jointCanvas and findingFocus now carry their own observations, a twentieth check fails on any page or console error accumulated across all four page sessions (the first was unwatched until cross-verification), the accumulator drains on read so one error is not counted twice, and schemaVersion must be present on both sides. The C7 camera guard is in: the fingerprint must resolve to at least one rebar on both sides of the drag, and the change must be in a point that reads a rebar.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"Claude Opus 5 (direct, outside the codex harness — user instruction)\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 5,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"cross-verification\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"verify\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"refuted\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Four Antigravity CLI agents, read-only, each on a different scope. Refutations that landed: (a) step 0's refutation of C7 — a modifier-held left drag pans in OrbitControls, so the mechanism IS reachable; (b) WorkPackageBoard has the same unguarded joint target ReviewPane had; (c) openDraft let the ambient selection override the finding's own column; (d) the new diagnostics check misses the first page session, drains before clearStore, never clears the in-page accumulator, and catches almost nothing of value. Surviving: claims A-E on the phase diff, and the C7 guard itself once written. Verdicts kept verbatim as cross-verification-1..4; the index is cross-verification.md.\\\",\\n      \\\"verified_by\\\": \\\"Antigravity CLI (agy, bypermissions), four agents in Herdr panes at the user's instruction\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 6,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"close-cross-verification-findings\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Added the C7 camera guard on both sides of the drag (floor 1, measured and printed as UC25 CAMERA_ORACLE — a floor of 3 was tried and blocked a passing run), guarded WorkPackageBoard, made openDraft take the finding's own column, and fixed the three diagnostics holes. Corrected the records the refutations falsified: step0 C7, step1, step4, this index, and phase 48's step8-report known holes and index summary. The z-fighting cause that phase 48 retracted was still asserted as fact in three closed-phase documents; all three now state the measurement without the cause.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"Claude Opus 5 (direct, outside the codex harness — user instruction)\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-18T18:30:00+0900\\\",\\n  \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-18T21:45:00+0900\\\",\\n  \\\"note\\\": \\\"Implemented directly by Claude rather than by scripts/execute.py, at the user instruction \\\\\\\"그래 지금 너가 직접 다 끝내\\\\\\\". The gate (step 0) upheld C1-C6 and at first refuted C7. Four Antigravity CLI agents then cross-verified the phase at the user's instruction: they overturned the C7 refutation and found two further real defects (WorkPackageBoard unguarded, openDraft taking the ambient selection over the finding's own column) plus three holes in the new diagnostics check. All were fixed and the step records corrected. See cross-verification.md.\\\"\\n}\\n--- phases/48-joint-review-ui/index.json\\n{\\n  \\\"project\\\": \\\"Kijun\\\",\\n  \\\"phase\\\": \\\"48-joint-review-ui\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n  \\\"steps\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 1,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"viewer-state-and-joint-layout\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"xhigh\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T19:21:39+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"스토어 viewer 상태·접합부 순수 레이아웃·ViewerTabs 3탭·i18n을 추가하고 좌표/범위/변이 회귀를 통과시켰다.\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T19:42:32+0900\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"viewer-joint-scene\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"xhigh\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T19:42:33+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"Viewer3D에 접합부 씬, 참고 박스, 검사 마커, 카메라 pose 캡처/복원, 미지원 大梁 이동 UI와 회귀 테스트를 추가했다.\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T20:07:44+0900\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 3,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"review-tabs-joint-xray\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"xhigh\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T20:07:45+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"ReviewTabs·ReviewPane·useReviewModel과 接合部·Calculation X-Ray 테스트를 추가했다.\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T20:29:47+0900\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 4,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"review-check\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"xhigh\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T20:29:51+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"形状検査のあき入力・除外・手動実行・判定結果・指摘行フォーカスを ReviewPane に追加し、i18n と反証テストを整えた。\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T20:45:49+0900\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 5,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"review-items\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T20:45:51+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"検討項目の生成·確認·保留·判断不可·再現·再検討 필터·고지를 완성하고 대상 fingerprint 및 변경 불변 테스트와 3개 변이 반증을 기록했다.\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T22:42:34+0900\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 6,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"review-compare\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T22:42:34+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"HOLDのS1〜S3を修正し、深い基準案コピー・entity/表示差分・対応確認バッジ・選択/support表示をTDDと実変異で検証した。\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T23:47:21+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"previous_hold\\\": \\\"Archived .git/phase48-run/step6-hold-original; must obtain fresh independent PASS\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 7,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"work-packages\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T23:47:21+0900\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"作業パッケージの作成·チェックリスト·準備状態派生表示を実装し、作業タブ接続と変異回帰を追加した。\\\",\\n      \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T15:17:05+0000\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 8,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"e2e-flow\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"uc25 19/19 checks true on two consecutive runs and the seven regressions pass on a production build (BUILD_ID IV5UMpDB0S9L8kK-uCe2y); vitest 2032/2032, tsc and lint exit 0. Three test-side repairs, no product change: a declared 1440x900 viewport fixture, a raycast-based camera oracle replacing the pixel comparison (the joint scene never rendered two byte-identical frames under any tested condition - 11 distinct hashes in 11 captures, pointer held, cut plane at maximum; the z-fighting cause first given for this was retracted as unestablished, the measurement stands), and base64 Buffer input matching the other e2e scripts. Details in step8-report.json under desktop_host_run.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"claude-opus-5 (desktop host session) - repairs written here, so this session is not their independent reviewer\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 9,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"perf-browser\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"uc25-perf.js로 접합부 4조작을 프로덕션 빌드·headless에서 실측했다. 중앙값은 샘플 39/96/157/35 ms, 5층 스트레스 138/551/925/414 ms로 예산(1500/3000/3000/500) 안이다. rAF은 헤드리스에서 1Hz로 조여지므로 전부 DOM 폴링으로 쟀다. 개별 표본 2건(3034 ms·765 ms)은 예산을 넘었고 report에 그대로 적었다.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"claude-opus-5 (desktop host session)\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 10,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"docs-sync\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"ADR-049(검토 계층 10결정)·R18(형상 검사 가정 5 ＋ あき 出典 부재)을 쓰고, CLAUDE.md＝AGENTS.md에 마일스톤 행·아키텍처 규칙·R18 행을 같은 문장으로 넣었다. ARCHITECTURE 트리에 review 3디렉터리, tests/e2e/README에 uc25-perf 행. 코드 무변경.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"claude-opus-5 (desktop host session)\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"step\\\": 11,\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"refute-ui\\\",\\n      \\\"kind\\\": \\\"verify\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"completed\\\",\\n      \\\"model\\\": \\\"gpt-5.6-luna\\\",\\n      \\\"reasoning_effort\\\": \\\"max\\\",\\n      \\\"summary\\\": \\\"phase 48 전체를 10항목 오라클로 반증 시도했고 전부 성립(upheld). 数量은 e1031a2와 HEAD가 바이트 동일(sha256 2건 일치), 표시부는 판정 함수를 부르지 않으며, step1이 보고한 변이를 실제로 넣자 보고된 그 테스트 하나만 실패했다(되돌림). 항목 9의 이스케이프 검출은 셸이 백슬래시를 먹은 오라클 쪽 거짓 양성이었다.\\\",\\n      \\\"authored_by\\\": \\\"claude-opus-5 (desktop host session)\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-17T19:21:39+0900\\\",\\n  \\\"completed_at\\\": \\\"2026-09-18T19:40:00+0900\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_40\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"rg -n 'coverage|@vitest/coverage' package.json package-lock.json vitest.config.* 2>/dev/null || true && date --iso-8601=seconds\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in_progress\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_40\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc \\\"rg -n 'coverage|@vitest/coverage' package.json package-lock.json vitest.config.* 2>/dev/null || true && date --iso-8601=seconds\\\"\",\"aggregated_output\":\"package-lock.json:13522:        \\\"@vitest/coverage-istanbul\\\": \\\"4.1.10\\\",\\npackage-lock.json:13523:        \\\"@vitest/coverage-v8\\\": \\\"4.1.10\\\",\\npackage-lock.json:13548:        \\\"@vitest/coverage-istanbul\\\": {\\npackage-lock.json:13551:        \\\"@vitest/coverage-v8\\\": {\\n2026-09-19T22:45:46+09:00\\n\",\"exit_code\":0,\"status\":\"completed\"}}\n{\"type\":\"item.started\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_41\",\"type\":\"command_execution\",\"command\":\"/bin/bash -lc 'npm ls @vitest/coverage-v8 --depth=0'\",\"aggregated_output\":\"\",\"exit_code\":null,\"status\":\"in